<div class="t" data-a="-1" data-b=".17" data-h="1"><div class="qi" data-a="is reading the noise"></div><h1><span class="l1">Your bank statement knows what you spent.</span><span class="l2" id="qk" aria-label="Q knows why."></span></h1><p>Q reads your bank SMS on your phone and turns every transaction into scores, streaks, a persona and an offline AI coach.</p><div class="row"><a class="cta mag" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScmCpTVTtPm-iPd6ydDfGvCnTN23XXn-IyL7ZkaWOMUwWw7Og/viewform?usp=header">Join the Alpha</a><a class="cta o mag" href="#product">Explore Q</a></div></div>
<div class="hs g g4" id="hs"><div class="hlg" aria-hidden="true"><div style="--d:.3s"><span>Amazon</span><b>−₹1,192</b></div><div style="--d:.6s"><span>Swiggy</span><b>−₹384</b></div><div style="--d:.9s"><span>Uber</span><b>−₹220</b></div><div style="--d:1.2s"><span>Netflix</span><b>−₹649</b></div></div><small class="sm" style="display:block;margin:8px 0 6px;padding-top:8px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.1)">Q analysis · 214 transactions</small><div><div><small>Financial Wellness</small><b class="n">742</b></div><span class="sm" style="text-align:right">Pattern found:<br>late-night spending</span></div>
<div class="mb"><span>Discipline</span><i style="--w:86%"></i><b>86</b></div><div class="mb"><span>Impulse</span><i style="--w:72%;--c:var(--rd)"></i><b>72</b></div><div class="mb"><span>Savings</span><i style="--w:91%;--c:var(--ok)"></i><b>91</b></div></div>
<div class="t" data-a=".16" data-b=".30"><h2>Your spending looks random.</h2></div>
<div class="t" data-a=".35" data-b=".53"><h2>Until you see <em>the pattern.</em></h2></div>
<div class="t" data-a=".53" data-b=".72"><h2>Q doesn't just track your money. <em>It studies your behavior.</em></h2></div>
<div class="t" data-a=".72" data-b="1.1"><h2>And turns behavior into <em>something you can change.</em></h2></div>
</div></div>

<section data-cam="c" data-mood="2" class="sec" id="product"><h2 class="hd">One score. <em>Four forces behind it.</em></h2><p class="lede">Tap a metric to see how your Financial Score reacts.</p>
<div class="scorebox"><div id="sorb"></div></div><div class="chips" id="chips"></div></section>

<section data-cam="f" class="sec" id="rhythm" data-mood="2"><div class="qi" data-f="found a time pattern"></div><div class="mo"><small>Your money</small><b>has a rhythm.</b></div><p class="lede">Each dot is a purchase, placed at the hour you made it. Drag around the dial.</p>
<svg class="clock" id="clock" viewBox="-130 -130 260 260" tabindex="0" role="slider" aria-label="Hour of day" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="24"></svg><div class="tip" id="rdo" aria-live="polite"></div><div class="qn" id="qn"><small>Q NOTICED</small><b>Your spending changes after 9 PM.</b><p></p><button class="cta o" id="qx">Explore pattern</button></div>
<div class="mo" style="margin-top:12vh"><small>Most of your impulse spending</small><b class="rv" id="after">happens after 9 PM.</b><small>Q finds it.</small></div></section>
<section data-cam="s" data-mood="2" class="sec" id="how"><h2 class="hd">Collectible identities. <em>Built from what you actually do.</em></h2>
<div class="deckw" id="deck"></div><div class="dk"><button id="pp" aria-label="Previous persona">‹</button><span id="pi" class="sm" style="min-width:170px;text-align:center" aria-live="polite"></span><button id="pn" aria-label="Next persona">›</button></div></section>

<section data-cam="i" class="sec" id="fpr" data-mood="2"><div class="qi" data-f="found your behavioral signature"></div><div class="mo"><small>Your habits leave</small><b>a signature.</b></div><p class="lede" id="fpl"></p><svg class="fp" id="fp" viewBox="-110 -110 220 220" role="img" aria-label="Behavioral fingerprint"></svg><div class="pbtn" id="fpb"></div></section>
<section data-mood="2" class="sec" style="padding:26svh 22px"><svg class="patbg" id="patbg" viewBox="-110 -110 220 220" aria-hidden="true"></svg><div class="mo"><small>Your money</small><b class="rv" id="pat" style="font-size:clamp(46px,15vw,170px)">has a pattern.</b><small>Q finds it.</small></div></section>
<section data-cam="a" data-mood="2" class="sec"><div class="qi" data-f="mapped the last 30 days"></div><h2 class="hd">Thirty days, <em>as a skyline.</em></h2><p class="lede">Drag to explore, tap a building.</p><p class="flow"><span>Height = spend</span><i>·</i><span>Colour = signal: red impulse, amber watch, green disciplined</span><i>·</i><span>Left to right = time</p>
<div class="mapw" id="mapw"><svg id="map" viewBox="0 0 600 460" role="img" aria-label="30-day spending skyline"></svg></div><div class="tip" id="tip" aria-live="polite"><span class="sm">Tap a day.</span></div></section>

<section class="phone-sec" id="phone" data-mood="3" aria-label="Q turns patterns into decisions"><div class="pstick">
<div class="qfar" aria-hidden="true"></div><p class="pk">Q turns patterns into decisions.</p><div class="psig" id="psig" aria-hidden="true"></div>
<div class="pscene"><div class="phone3" id="ph3" role="img" aria-label="The Q app: a raw transaction becomes a pattern, a behavior, an insight and an action"><i class="pe e1"></i><i class="pe e2"></i><i class="pe e3"></i><div class="pbody"><div class="pscr" id="pscr"></div><b class="pisl"></b></div></div></div>
<ol class="pst" id="pst" aria-hidden="true"><li>Raw</li><li>Pattern</li><li>Behavior</li><li>Insight</li><li>Action</li></ol>
<div class="mo pfin" id="pfin"><small>Q doesn't only observe. Q helps you</small><b class="rv" id="chg" style="font-size:clamp(56px,17vw,170px)">change it.</b></div></div></section>
<section data-cam="i" data-mood="3" class="sec"><div class="stage two"><div><h2 class="hd">The 24-hour rule.</h2><p class="lede">Lock a want inside the Cooling Off Chamber. If it still matters tomorrow, it's yours.</p></div>
<div id="ch"><div class="stp" id="stp"><span>Want</span><span>Wait 24h</span><span>Decide</span><span>Saved</span></div><div class="cham g g3" id="cham"><div class="lid"></div><div class="item g g4"><small>Sneakers</small><b>₹2,499</b></div><div class="tm" id="ct">24:00</div></div><div class="res" id="res"></div><div class="vault" id="vault" aria-label="Savings"><i></i></div></div></div></section>

<section data-cam="s" data-mood="3" class="sec"><div class="stage two"><div><div class="qi" data-f="found a leak"></div><h2 class="hd">Small leaks <em>sink budgets.</em></h2><p class="lede">Subscriptions drain your balance quietly, a little every month.</p></div>
<div id="lk"><div class="sbs"><div class="g g2">Netflix<br><b>₹649</b></div><div class="g g2">Spotify<br><b>₹119</b></div><div class="g g2">YouTube<br><b>₹189</b></div></div><div class="stp" id="stl" style="justify-content:flex-start"><span>Leak</span><span>Detected</span><span>Stopped</span><span>Returned</span></div><div class="tank g g3"><div class="lq"></div><div class="found g g4"><small>Q found a leak</small><b>₹18,420 / year</b><span class="sm">in unused subscriptions, back in your balance</span></div></div></div></div></section>

<section data-cam="f" data-mood="4" class="sec"><div class="stage two"><div><div class="qi" data-f="found the cause"></div><h2 class="hd">Diagnostics, <em>not chat.</em></h2><p class="flow" style="font-size:clamp(17px,4.6vw,26px);letter-spacing:-.03em;color:var(--ink)">Chatbots answer questions. Q investigates behavior.</p><p class="lede">Your financial data doesn't need to leave your phone.</p><div class="row" style="margin-top:18px"><span class="tag" style="color:var(--ai)">OFFLINE</span><span class="tag" style="color:var(--sil)">100% PRIVATE</span></div></div>
<div class="ai g g3" id="ai"><div style="margin-bottom:10px">Why did I spend so much this month?</div><div class="lg2">214 transactions read</div><div class="lg2">Time analysis</div><div class="lg2">Category clustering</div><div class="lg2">Behavior vs 30-day average</div><div class="lg2">Pattern detected: late-night food delivery</div><div class="bars" id="bars"></div><small>Food delivery by hour</small><div class="ans" id="ans"><small>DIAGNOSIS</small><br>Most of the increase came from <em>late-night food delivery</em>: <em>31% more</em> than your 30-day average, mostly between 9 PM and 12 AM.</div></div></div></section>

<section data-cam="i" data-mood="5" class="sec" id="privacy"><h2 class="hd">Your money is private. <em>Your data should be too.</em></h2><p class="flow">Your transactions<i>→</i>Q<i>→</i>Local analysis<i>→</i>Stays on your device</p>
<div class="priv" style="margin-top:30px"><div class="pvs"><div class="g g2" style="grid-column:1">✓ On device</div><div class="g g2" style="grid-column:1">✓ Verified bank SMS</div><div class="g g2" style="grid-column:3;grid-row:1">✓ No OTP</div><div class="g g2" style="grid-column:3;grid-row:2">✓ No selling, no lending</div></div>
<div class="pv"><span class="cl">cloud <b>✕</b></span><div class="gp g g4"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i class="x"></i><i class="x" style="margin-left:22px;animation-delay:1.4s"></i><small style="text-align:center">analysis<br>stays here</small></div></div>
<div class="g g2" style="padding:16px;font-weight:700;--r:18px;justify-self:stretch">✓ Offline AI</div></div></section>

<section data-cam="a" data-mood="6" class="sec"><h2 class="hd">Not another <em>expense tracker.</em></h2>
<div class="cmp reveal" id="cmp"><div class="old"><small>Traditional expense tracker</small><p>You spent ₹500.</p></div><div class="nq"><small>Q</small><p>You spent ₹500 at 9:42 PM.</p><p>That's your third late-night food purchase this week.</p><p>Your average is ₹320.</p><p class="hl">Q detected a recurring pattern.</p></div></div>
<p class="big"><span class="d rv" id="s1">One records what happened.</span><span class="rv" id="s2" data-d="1.2">Q helps explain why.</span></p></section>

<section data-cam="c" data-mood="7" class="sec" id="pricing"><h2 class="hd" style="text-align:center">Q Pro.</h2>
<div class="pass g g2"><small>Membership pass</small><div class="seg" role="group" aria-label="Billing"><button id="bm" aria-pressed="true">Monthly</button><button id="by" aria-pressed="false">Yearly</button></div>
<div class="pr"><span id="pr">₹99</span><small id="pu"> / month</small></div><p class="sm" id="pn" style="margin-top:6px">First 7 days free.</p>
<div class="pills"><span>Behavior scoring</span><span>Financial Persona</span><span>30-Day Map</span><span>Discipline Streaks</span><span>24-Hour Rule</span><span>Leak Detection</span><span>AI Coach</span><span>Monthly Wrap</span></div>
<a class="cta mag" style="width:100%" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScmCpTVTtPm-iPd6ydDfGvCnTN23XXn-IyL7ZkaWOMUwWw7Og/viewform?usp=header">Join the Alpha</a></div></section>

<section data-cam="f" data-mood="7" class="sec" id="faq"><h2 class="hd">FAQ</h2><div style="margin-top:24px">
<details><summary>Why does Q need my SMS?</summary><p>Q reads bank transaction alerts so you never log an expense by hand. Access is required; there's no manual-entry fallback.</p></details>
<details><summary>Is my data actually private?</summary><p>Only verified bank sender IDs are read. Personal texts and OTPs are never touched, and the AI Coach analyzes on your phone.</p></details>
<details><summary>Why Android only?</summary><p>Automatic SMS reading relies on an Android permission iOS doesn't expose. iOS would need a bank-integration approach that isn't built yet.</p></details>
<details><summary>What happens after the free trial?</summary><p>You're billed ₹99/month or ₹999/year from day 8, cancellable any time in your phone's subscription settings.</p></details>
<details><summary>When can I download it?</summary><p>Q is in active development. Join the alpha and your feedback shapes what gets built next.</p></details></div></section>

<section data-mood="7" id="final"><div class="world" id="w2"></div><div class="ft"><h2><span class="rv" id="f1">Know where your money goes.</span><em class="rv" id="f2" data-d="1.8">Understand why.</em></h2><div class="row late" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:30px"><a class="cta mag" style="min-height:60px;padding:0 44px;font-size:17px" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScmCpTVTtPm-iPd6ydDfGvCnTN23XXn-IyL7ZkaWOMUwWw7Og/viewform?usp=header">Join the Q Alpha</a></div><p class="sm" style="margin-top:18px">Q is currently in development.</p></div></section>
</main>
<footer>Q is currently in development and is not yet available on Google Play. This page describes the planned product; details and pricing may change before launch. The alpha link opens an external Google Form.</footer>
